From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] interconnect: DEBUG: enable the debugfs test client

Debug-only, drop once the SM8750 s2idle wake bisect is done. Enables
/sys/kernel/debug/interconnect/test_client so an interconnect path can
be voted from userspace, to find which BCM on the PCIe memory path must
stay in the RPMh sleep set for the SoC to wake from s2idle. Upstream
keeps this behind a source edit because root can vote arbitrary
bandwidth with it.
---
--- a/drivers/interconnect/debugfs-client.c
+++ b/drivers/interconnect/debugfs-client.c
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
  * configuration option for this feature.
  * People who want to use this will need to modify the source code directly.
  */
-#undef INTERCONNECT_ALLOW_WRITE_DEBUGFS
+#define INTERCONNECT_ALLOW_WRITE_DEBUGFS
 
 #if defined(INTERCONNECT_ALLOW_WRITE_DEBUGFS) && defined(CONFIG_DEBUG_FS)
 
